{"id": "progress-sf-state-and-city-contribution-reports", "title": "Progress San Francisco reported $1.16 million in contributions to the wrong office", "seconds": 46.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "e632b1303db9c738", "words": 120, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In 2018, a firefighters’ committee raised money to support London Breed.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.58, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["The", "receiving", "committee"], "sub": "Progress San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.52, 1.02, 1.1, 1.79, 2.24, 2.58, 2.87, 3.0, 3.47, 3.91]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "It reported $410,000 from Progress San Francisco.", "t0": 4.7, "t1": 8.82, "shot": "r0-part1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "It reported $410,000 from Progress San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.63, 0.92, 1.32, 1.62, 2.05, 2.44, 2.62, 3.13, 3.35]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Six transfers totaling $320,000 appear in the Commission’s June election counts.", "t0": 8.94, "t1": 14.59, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$320,000", "label": "Six transfers"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 1.08, 1.48, 1.75, 2.05, 2.41, 2.82, 3.23, 3.56, 3.63, 3.72, 4.29, 4.61, 5.11]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A separate December contribution was missing from the original year-end filing.", "t0": 14.81, "t1": 19.34, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "f176225809", "kicker": "The original filing", "text": "Safe & Clean Sunset Coalition", "mark": "Sunset"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.63, 1.11, 1.77, 1.98, 2.41, 2.62, 2.74, 3.27, 3.83]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The July amendment named the committee supporting Jessica Ho.", "t0": 19.46, "t1": 22.53, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$6,511.93", "label": "Corrected contribution"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.5, 0.99, 1.23, 1.32, 1.69, 2.23, 2.69]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "It listed $6,511.93.", "t0": 22.65, "t1": 26.71, "shot": "r3-part1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "It listed $6,511.93"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.56, 0.85, 1.33, 1.63, 1.94, 2.3, 2.73, 2.9, 3.51]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Across three elections, the contributions required local reports.", "t0": 26.93, "t1": 30.93, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,159,900", "label": "Local reporting violations"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 0.79, 1.5, 1.65, 2.43, 2.91, 3.27]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "They totaled $1,159,900.", "t0": 31.05, "t1": 33.67, "shot": "r4-part1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "They totaled $1,159,900"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.55, 0.85, 1.07, 1.36, 1.6, 1.98]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The reports went to the state.", "t0": 33.79, "t1": 35.38, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$29,300", "label": "Disclosure penalty"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.6, 0.87, 0.97, 1.09]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The committee denied an intent to conceal.", "t0": 35.5, "t1": 37.72, "shot": "r5-part1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The committee denied an intent to conceal"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.5, 0.89, 1.02, 1.41, 1.53]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Ethics Commission imposed $29,300 for the disclosure violations.", "t0": 37.84, "t1": 43.28, "shot": "r5-part2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The Ethics Commission imposed $29,300 for the disclosure violations"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.62, 1